    "name": "Apache ShardingSphere REST Cluster Databases API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Apache ShardingSphere is a distributed SQL transaction and query engine that transforms any database into a distributed database system. This API provides REST endpoints for managing sharding rules, data sources, read-write splitting, and cluster configuration via DistSQL.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Apache ShardingSphere",
